    text: "Our Ways of Working has several core elements. We are accountable and take ownership for solving issues Behaviours We empower our people We connect and work across boundaries We do the basics brilliantly We put user needs at the centre We are innovative and contemporary Digital Delivery Framework Methods Our Digital Delivery Framework is an end-to-end, repeatable delivery pipeline. It ensures consistent delivery practices and the best outcomes for customers and clients. The following principles underpin the framework: Have a plan, but adjust as you go Set clear governance and a shared purpose Be disciplined and transparent Collaboration underpins success We apply industry best practices and whole of government endorsed methods, including: Design Thinking: central to the DES delivery framework. It ensures solutions are built around real user needs, driving higher adoption, satisfaction, and business value. Project Management: Delivery enabled through defined scope, structured planning, risk management, and disciplined tracking against milestones tied to business outcomes. Agile: Adaptability and rapid delivery of project outcomes through iterative development and continuous feedback. Lean: Lean thinking emphasises identifying value, minimising waste, optimising delivery and continually improving.",
